#u:(~hello) ~hello

u: (Yes) $onStopped=1 \pau=1000\ Okey, lunch time is from 12 pm to 2 pm. 
u: (I want to book for 12pm) $onStopped=1 \pau=1000\ Sorry, there are no tables free at 12pm, but there are free tables at 12 pm, but there are free tables at 1 pm and 2 pm. which one is more suitable for you?
u: (Could you book for 1pm) $onStopped=1 \pau=1000\ Okey your reservation for lunch at 1pm is confirmed, your reservation number is L13
u: (Thank you) $onStopped=1 \pau=1000\ See you bye bye